--
396-\item \textbf{Presc[7:0]:} Amount of FPGA clock cycles between ADC samples.
397-$$ SR_{ADC} = \frac{\SI{102.4}{\mega\hertz}}{Presc} $$
398-The minimum value for this register is 112, which results in a samplerate of roughly \SI{914.3}{\kilo\hertz}. If Presc is set to a lower value, the data acquisition from the ADC is not done when the next sample starts and samples will be skipped.
399-\end{itemize}
